1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,480
My reflection just blinked three seconds before I did. I am not crazy. I am terrified.

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:12,828
I drop my toothbrush into the sink, but the glass woman in front of me catches it first.

3
00:00:13,128 --> 00:00:19,632
She steps closer to the glass border, her breath fogging up my side of the cold surface.

4
00:00:19,932 --> 00:00:26,220
I try to scream for help, but she covers her own mouth and silences my voice completely.

5
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:33,456
A heavy fist slams against the glass from the inside, cracking the frame right down the middle.

6
00:00:33,756 --> 00:00:41,076
The shattered surface peels away like wallpaper, revealing a bright, furnished room on the other side.

7
00:00:41,376 --> 00:00:49,296
I am standing in a clean, quiet apartment, watching a terrified girl trapped inside a tiny mirror.

8
00:00:49,596 --> 00:00:55,668
She pounds on the glass, begging me to let her out, but I finally know true freedom.

9
00:00:55,968 --> 00:01:02,496
I toss the mirror into a dark backpack, leaving her behind in the endless loop of the past.

10
00:01:02,796 --> 00:01:09,684
As I walk out the front door, my phone screen flashes. Who is watching whom right now?
